  "note": "Single-hw_context overlay + per-shape ELF module set for the NPU decode (gemv, M=1) path. Register one overlay per (dtype,K); load each shape's ELF as an xrt::module into that context. QUANT (q4_0/q4k/q6k) overlays+ELFs now carry the 4-COLUMN SIMD core (gemv_mc.py --cols 4; vectorized MAC + aie::unpack in mv_q4*.cc/mv_q6k.cc) -- matches the promoted standalone gemv xclbins, so GGML_XRT_OVERLAY can be re-enabled once validated. bf16 is single-column (mv.cc). UNVALIDATED (compiled on Linux, not executed on NPU).",
